# e lists the block's tags, marking unsupported ones, and Esc closes it without a change.
file <<END
Packing:
	- Toothbrush @due(2026-12-01) @owner(me)
END
keys j e
see Edit Node
see @owner(me) unsupported
keys <Esc>
hide Edit Node
quit
saved <<END
Packing:
	- Toothbrush @due(2026-12-01) @owner(me)
END
